<title>UK: SBC set call and put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC set call and put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one index.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.JUL.97		 PAYDATE	25.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $694.61</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	  GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	    $740.00     $2.41	   10.00 PCT     28.82 X</p>
<p> PUT	     $740.00     $5.47	  - 1.34 PCT     12.70 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
